analysis:
(1) 由 $a>0, b>0, \frac{1}{a}+\frac{2}{b}=2$ 得: $2 \sqrt{\frac{1}{a} \cdot \frac{2}{b}} \leq \frac{1}{a}+\frac{2}{b}=2$, 即: $a b \geq 2$;

等号成立的充要条件是 $\left\{\frac{1}{a}+\frac{2}{b}=2\right.$

$$
\frac{1}{a}=\frac{2}{b}
$$

(2) $a+2 b=\frac{1}{2}(a+2 b)\left(\frac{1}{a}+\frac{2}{b}\right)=\frac{1}{2}\left(5+\frac{2 b}{a}+\frac{2 a}{b}\right) \geq \frac{1}{2}\left(5+2 \sqrt{\frac{2 b}{a} \cdot \frac{2 a}{b}}\right)=\frac{9}{2}$;

等号成立的充要条件是 $\left\{\begin{array}{l}\frac{1}{a}+\frac{2}{b}=2 \\ \frac{2 b}{a}=\frac{2 a}{b}\end{array}\right.$ 且 $a>0, b>0$, 即: $a=b=\frac{3}{2}$;

$\therefore \boldsymbol{a}+2 \boldsymbol{b}$ 的最小值为 $\frac{9}{2}$; 此时 $a=b=\frac{3}{2}$.

